# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LeadLine — where quote requests go
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# With both of these set, the contact form POSTs straight to the LeadLine API.
# That records the lead, emails info@fusionautolab.com immediately, and sends
# the customer an AI-written acknowledgement within about a minute.
#
# Get the site key by running `pnpm seed:fusion` in the LeadLine repo — it
# prints both of these lines ready to paste.
VITE_LEADLINE_SITE_KEY=
VITE_LEADLINE_API=https://api.frontedesk.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fallback form service (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only used when the two LeadLine values above are blank. Formspree, Web3Forms,
# Getform and Netlify Forms all accept a plain POST.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=

# With none of the above set, the form opens the visitor's email app with every
# field pre-filled and addressed to info@fusionautolab.com, so nothing is lost.
